# ROUND 18 — THE BRIDGE, CUSTODY (ruling #7 of 21/08/2026 · specs/bridge-spec.md
# § 6). A Wings Ahead export and a cross-check report are DATA WITH REAL NAMES —
# the same class of thing as the private roster and the encrypted store. The
# pane never writes either to disk, but a hand-saved copy must not be able to
# reach a commit by accident.
wings-ahead-export-*.json
wa-export-*.json
bridge-report-*
